    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.63,
      224.59,
      451.69,
      262.46
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends the Rubber Control Act (Chapter 436) (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section as amended isto replace wherever the words \u201cController\u201d and \u201cRubber Controller\u201d appear with the word\u201cDirector-General\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.63,
      272.59,
      451.68,
      291.26
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause repeals section 26 of the principal enactment and is a consequentialamendment to Clause 4.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.63,
      301.39,
      451.78,
      329.66
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4 : This clause repeals the heading \u201cRUBBER CONTROL FUND AND RUBBERADVISORY BOARD\u201d in Part VI of the principal enactment and inserts a new heading\u201cRUBBER ADVISORY BOARD\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.63,
      339.79,
      451.63,
      358.46
    ],
    "text": "Clause 5 : This clause repeals sections 36, 37, 38, 39A and 50 of the principalenactment and are consequential amendments to Clause 4.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.63,
      368.59,
      451.82,
      396.86
    ],
    "text": "Clause 6 : This clause amends section 52 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as amended is to repeal the existing definition for the expression \u201cController\u201dand insert a new definition for the expression \u201cDirector-General\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
