    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE RUBBER CONTROL ACT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      253.73,
      401.9,
      277.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      291.53,
      401.77,
      315.47
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Rubber Control(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      329.33,
      401.89,
      403.67
    ],
    "text": "2. (1) In the Rubber Control Act (Chapter 436) (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and any otherwritten law, there shall be substituted for the words,\u201cController\u201d and \u201cRubber Controller\u201d wherever such wordsappear in the principal enactment and any other written lawof the words, \u201cDirector-General\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      417.53,
      401.9,
      504.47
    ],
    "text": "(2) Every reference to the \u201cController\u201d and \u201cRubberController\u201d in any other written law or in any notice,notification, contract, communication form, other instrumentor document shall from and after the date of the coming intooperation of this Act be read and construed as a referencemade to the \u201cDirector-General of the Rubber DevelopmentDepartment\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      518.33,
      401.88,
      542.27
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 26 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      581.33,
      401.88,
      617.87
    ],
    "text": "4. The heading appearing immediately after the wordsand figure \u201cPART VI\u201d of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed and the following heading substituted therefor: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
